    "text": "When the temperature of a black body increases, it is observed that the wavelength corresponding of maximum energy changes from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>μm</mi></math>&nbsp;to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>μm</mi></math><span style=\"line-height: 20.7999992370605px;\">. The ratio of emissive powers of the body at the respective </span>temperature <span style=\"line-height: 20.7999992370605px;\">is</span>",
